{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51802","headline":"送王正己归山 · 任鹄","name":"送王正己归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五峯青拄天，直下挂[飞]（龙）泉。\n琴鹤同归去，烟霞到处眠。\n鼯跳霜叶径，虎啸夕阳川。\n独酌应怀我，排空树影连。\n（以上《诗话总龟》十五引《雅言杂载》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}